{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>What kind of &quot;game&quot; is this?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To be honest, we can't really define it precisely, especially when most of the experience is built on &quot;AI-generated content.&quot; All we can say is that this is a product featuring tens of thousands of 3D AI-driven characters, where players enjoy complete freedom to create stories and scripts. It's also one that will continuously evolve with new and entertaining AI-driven gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Free Chat:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engage with the AI companion using your text, or go ahead and use voice chat, even send images or gifts to strengthen your connection and deepen your relationship over time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391170/extras/\u6587\u5b57\u804a\u5929.gif?t=1745462887\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391170/extras/\u89e6\u6478\u53cd\u9988.gif?t=1745462887\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391170/extras/\u76f8\u518c\u804a\u5929\u52a8\u56fe.gif?t=1745462887\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Discover Your Ideal AI Companion:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find your perfect match among tens of thousands of unique AI entities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391170/extras/\u5e73\u53f0\u641c\u7d22.gif?t=1745462887\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Create Your Own AI Companion:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upload content, customize appearances, design from scratch, or use any DIY method you can think of to bring your unique AI to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391170/extras/\u4e0a\u4f20\u6a21\u578b.gif?t=1745462887\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>AI-Generated Scripts:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tasks and storylines that evolve differently based on every action you take and every word you speak.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391170/extras/\u5267\u672c\u4efb\u52a1.gif?t=1745462887\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Intimate Interactions:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">How about lying in bed together to listen to a bedtime story? Or engaging in a deep conversation about an interesting piece of art? Give it a try!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Looking for even more unique ways to interact? We can't wait for you to discover them!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3391170?t=1745462887","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3391170?t=1745462887","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391170/2049bec89caf01288f36a10a80bbf8b955342012/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745462887","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391170/2049bec89caf01288f36a10a80bbf8b955342012/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745462887","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>What kind of &quot;game&quot; is this?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To be honest, we can't really define it precisely, especially wh