0\u6a21\u578b.gif?t=1745462887\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>AI-Generated Scripts:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tasks and storylines that evolve differently based on every action you take and every word you speak.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391170/extras/\u5267\u672c\u4efb\u52a1.gif?t=1745462887\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Intimate Interactions:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">How about lying in bed together to listen to a bedtime story? Or engaging in a deep conversation about an interesting piece of art? Give it a try!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Looking for even more unique ways to interact? We can't wait for you to discover them!</p>","developers":["2033Tech"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391170/header.jpg?t=1745462887","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257117200,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257117200/movie480.mp4?t=1742558587","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257117200/movie_max.mp4?t=1742558587"},"name":"0.7.0 Record","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257117200/1c83c6436f7e8309f41bf952449512118e7072c0/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1742558587","webm":{"480":"http: